      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. if it is a lockout though, what would be the main culprits in a soil like mine? i'm also curious about the microbial side of things—does adding the blood meal actually help the soil microbiome or could it potentially mess with the balance of the existing microbes since it's such a concentrated source?",
